er-heavy equal-weight index absorbs the demand-side pain and the pair captures it both ways. Net: the pair construction is sound, but the equity-leg rationale (rational strip discounting), the entry timing (negative relative momentum, weak trend), and the unproven demand-recovery assumption cap my confidence in the 6 conviction.",
